---

Upstream Traceability

The execution capability shall preserve traceability to the approved decision from which the action originated.

Current lineage:

SO-F-002
Observations
      ↓
SO-F-003
Operating Context
      ↓
SO-F-004
Generated Decision
      ↓
[Authorization]
      ↓
Approved Decision
      ↓
SO-F-005
Vehicle Action

Where technically and operationally appropriate, execution evidence should therefore allow the resulting action to be related back to the approved decision and its contextual basis.

