Downstream Traceability

Execution evidence shall maintain traceability to the approved decision that initiated the action.

Where execution state becomes an input to another AVIA capability, the receiving architecture shall preserve the relationship between:

Execution State
       ↓
Receiving Capability
       ↓
Subsequent System Behavior

The receiving capability has not yet been established.

