No specific authorization artifact is referenced at this stage because ownership has not yet been determined.

---

Verification and Validation Traceability

Verification and validation artifacts shall maintain traceability between:

- Approved decisions.
- Executed actions.
- Execution states.
- Applicable execution requirements.
- Verification evidence.
- Validation evidence.

This shall allow execution behavior to be evaluated without confusing execution evidence with authorization evidence.

---

Traceability Notes

SO-F-005 shall maintain traceability from approved decision through executed action and execution state.

Traceability shall support both forward and backward analysis.

Forward traceability shall establish what action resulted from an approved decision.

Backward traceability shall establish which approved decision and contextual lineage resulted in a recorded execution state.

Traceability shall not be interpreted as authorization.
